---
layout: layout.njk
title: Calendar
description: Calendar for Autonomous Software Engineering.
permalink: /calendar/
---
<header class="page-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.semester }}</p>
  <h1>Calendar</h1>
  <p>Mondays and Thursdays · 2:00–3:30 PM</p>
</header>

<section class="section-rule">
  <p class="notice">The schedule follows the Monsoon 2026 almanac. There is no lecture on Thu, 1 Oct (Friday timetable) or Mon, 9 Nov (no classwork).</p>
  <h2>Lecture meetings</h2>
  <dl class="calendar-list">
    {% for lecture in course.calendar.lectures %}<div><dt>{{ lecture.date }}</dt><dd>{{ lecture.detail }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="section-rule">
  <h2>Key dates</h2>
  <dl class="calendar-list">
    {% for event in course.calendar.keyDates %}<div><dt>{{ event.date }}</dt><dd>{{ event.detail }}</dd></div>{% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>
